        {
          "id": 1767251993,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I was responding to this warning.\n\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-socketcan.c:681 proto_tree_add_item called for hf_can_len  -  item type is FT_UINT8 but call has len 2\n\nWhich uses hf_can_len with a length of 2 and is inside the guard at line 657\n\n    if (can_packet_type == PACKET_TYPE_CAN_XL) {\n\n\nI think the issue was that you were not yet using the hf_canxl_len - will push an amendment that does that instead.",
